      "requirement": "The existing equality assertion must hold after a supported CBOR value is parsed, serialized, and parsed again.",
      "target_route": "Input bytes {0xf9, 0x7c, 0x01} decode as a half precision NaN. The changed float constructor stores NaN; to_cbor writes it as a double; the second from_cbor restores NaN; the entry compares the two JSON values.",
      "failure_condition": "JSON float equality uses ordinary floating point ==, so the two NaN values compare unequal and the existing assert(j1 == j2) fails.",
